{"sha": "f89907c4f9dffc0814ef28d537c4854774265eb08b56638d5d82b4a5adfd9942", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b3:lebesgue} 章 --- 勒贝格", "积分}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:lebesgue:1}", "(a) 若 $f$ 非减，则 $\\{f > t\\}$ 为 $\\varnothing$、$\\R$，", "或为射线 $\\intoo a{+\\infty}$ / $\\intco a{+\\infty}$，在", "各情形下均为博雷尔集；递减情形同理。导数 $f'(x) =", "\\lim_n n\\bigl(f(x + \\frac1n) - f(x)\\bigr)$ 是", "连续（从而可测）函数的逐点极限：", "由\\cref{prop:b3:lebesgue:stability}(c)可知。", "", "(b) $\\{f > t\\} = \\bigcup_{q \\in \\Q,\\, q > t}\\{f > q\\}$：若", "有理水平集可测，则一切水平集皆可测，且射线", "生成 $\\mathcal B(\\R)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:lebesgue:2}", "其一：$(1 + x/n)^n \\nearrow \\eu^x$（$x \\geq 0$），故", "被积函数逐点趋于 $\\eu^{-x}\\cos x$；当 $n \\geq 2$ 时，", "$(1 + x/n)^n \\geq (1 + x/2)^2$，由此得可积控制函数", "$(1 + x/2)^{-2}$。由控制收敛定理：", "\\[", "\\lim_n\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{\\cos x}{(1 + x/n)^n}\\dd x", "= \\int_0^\\infty \\eu^{-x}\\cos x\\,\\dd x", "= \\operatorname{Re}\\int_0^\\infty\\eu^{-(1 - \\iu)x}\\dd x", "= \\operatorname{Re}\\frac{1}{1 - \\iu} = \\frac12 .", "\\]", "其二：作代换 $u = x^n$（为 $\\mathcal C^1$", "$\\intoo01$ 上的双射）：", "\\[", "\\int_0^1\\frac{nx^{n-1}}{1 + x}\\dd x = \\int_0^1\\frac{\\dd u}{1 +", "u^{1/n}} \\longrightarrow \\int_0^1\\frac{\\dd u}{2} = \\frac12,", "\\]", "由控制收敛定理：对 $u \\in \\intoo01$，$u^{1/n} \\to 1$，且", "被积函数在有限测度空间上以 $1$ 为界。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:lebesgue:3}", "(a) 取 $f_n = n\\,\\mathbf 1_{\\intoo0{1/n}}$：逐点有 $\\liminf f_n = 0$，", "$\\int f_n = 1$，故 $0 < 1$。", "", "(b) 高度：$n\\mathbf 1_{\\intoo0{1/n}}$；宽度：$\\frac1n\\mathbf", "1_{\\intoo0n}$；平移：$\\mathbf 1_{\\intoo n{n+1}}$。全部", "逐点趋于 $0$，且 $\\int = 1$。各情形下", "\\emph{控制}假设不成立：$\\sup_nf_n$ 为", "$\\approx 1/x$（在 $0$ 附近）、$\\approx$ 不可积的", "常值型，形如 $\\mathbf 1_{\\intoo1\\infty}$ 者 --- 皆不可积。", "", "(c) “$\\int\\limsup f_n \\geq \\limsup\\int f_n$” 不成立，", "对平移凸峰：左边为 $0$，右边为 $1$。", "“$\\limsup\\int \\leq \\int\\limsup$”是同一结论。又", "对 $\\limsup$ 的法图引理，把 $\\leq$ 反向", "（“逆法图引理”）需要一个控制函数 --- 同一凸峰", "即为反例。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:lebesgue:4}", "(a) 当 $x > 0$ 时：$\\frac1{\\eu^x - 1} = \\frac{\\eu^{-x}}{1 -", "\\eu^{-x}} = \\sum_{n\\geq1}\\eu^{-nx}$，故 $\\frac{x}{\\eu^x - 1} =", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}x\\eu^{-nx}$，为非负可测函数的级数，", "由\\cref{cor:b3:lebesgue:additivity}，可逐项", "积分：", "\\[", "\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{x\\,\\dd x}{\\eu^x - 1}", "= \\sum_{n\\geq1}\\int_0^\\infty x\\eu^{-nx}\\dd x", "= \\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac1{n^2} = \\frac{\\pi^2}6", "\\]", "（$\\int_0^\\infty x\\eu^{-nx}\\dd x = n^{-2}$，分部积分可得；巴塞尔", "问题见本科二年级分册，或见后文\\cref{exo:b3:hilbert:5}）。", "", "(b) 在 $\\intoo01$ 上，$-x\\ln x \\geq 0$，故 $x^{-x} =", "\\eu^{-x\\ln x} = \\sum_k\\frac{(-x\\ln x)^k}{k!}$ 为", "非负项的级数，再次交换求和与积分。作代换 $x =", "\\eu^{-u/(k+1)}$：", "\\[", "\\int_0^1(-x\\ln x)^k\\dd x", "= \\int_0^\\infty\\Bigl(\\frac{u}{k+1}\\Bigr)^{k}", "\\eu^{-\\frac{ku}{k+1}}\\;\\frac{\\eu^{-\\frac u{k+1}}}{k+1}\\,\\dd u", "= \\frac{1}{(k+1)^{k+1}}\\int_0^\\infty u^k\\eu^{-u}\\dd u", "= \\frac{k!}{(k+1)^{k+1}} .", "\\]", "于是 $\\int_0^1x^{-x}\\dd x = \\sum_{k\\geq0}\\frac{1}{(k+1)^{k+1}}", "= \\sum_{n\\geq1}n^{-n}$：即“大二学生之梦”，严格成立。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:lebesgue:5}", "(a) 马尔可夫不等式：$a\\,\\mathbf 1_{\\{f \\geq a\\}} \\leq f$，积分得", "$\\mu(\\{f \\geq a\\}) \\leq \\frac1a\\int f$。若 $\\int f = 0$：", "$\\mu(\\{f \\geq \\frac1n\\}) = 0$（对每个 $n$），且 $\\{f > 0\\} =", "\\bigcup_n\\{f \\geq \\frac1n\\}$ 为零测集。", "", "(b) $\\mu(\\{\\abs f = \\infty\\}) \\leq \\mu(\\{\\abs f \\geq n\\}) \\leq", "\\frac1n\\int\\abs f \\to 0$.", "", "(c) 取 $A = \\{f > 0\\}$：$\\int f^+\\dd\\mu = \\int_Af\\,\\dd\\mu =", "0$，故 $f^+ = 0$ 几乎处处（由 (a)）；同理 $f^- = 0$ 几乎处处。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:lebesgue:6}", "(a) $\\mathbf 1_\\Q$：处处不连续，", "不是黎曼可积的（见\\cref{thm:b3:lebesgue:riemann}）；其", "勒贝格积分为 $\\lambda(\\Q) = 0$。托马函数在", "每个无理点处连续（给定 $\\varepsilon$，", "$\\intcc01$ 中分母 $\\leq", "1/\\varepsilon$ 的有理数只有有限个；取小邻域避开它们），", "在有理点处不连续（无理数稠密）：", "几乎处处连续，黎曼可积，积分为 $0$（它几乎处处为零）。", "$\\mathbf 1_K$，$K$ 为胖康托尔集：间断点集为", "$\\partial K = K$（闭集且内部为空），测度为", "$\\frac12 > 0$：\\emph{不}黎曼可积 --- 然而", "勒贝格可积，积分为 $\\lambda(K) = \\frac12$。", ""]}